flowchart TB
    V[Fresh VPS] --> I[agentik install]
    I --> H[Hermes Ready]
    H --> O[Organization + OSs Applied]
    O --> P[Ponytail / Plugins / Profiles / Boards]
    P --> RU[READY_UNBOUND]
    RU --> DC[Connect Discord]
    DC --> BA[Authorize Bootstrap]
    BA --> INV[Inventory Guild]
    INV --> CMP[Compile Desired State]
    CMP --> PLAN[Plan / Diff]
    PLAN --> APPLY[Apply Safe Changes]
    APPLY --> BIND[Persist Team Bindings]
    BIND --> VER[Verify Routes + Permissions]
    VER --> DEM[Owner removes temporary Administrator]
    DEM --> SEC[RUNTIME_SECURED]
    SEC --> DOC[Doctor]
    DOC --> E2E[E2E Mission]
    E2E --> OP[OPERATIONAL]
